.\" SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only
.TH OCTA-CAPTURE-ACTIVATE 8 "" "OCTA-CAPTURE @PROJECT_VERSION@" "OCTA-CAPTURE Manual"
.SH NAME
octa\-capture\-activate \- bind OCTA-CAPTURE devices to the standalone module
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
\fBocta-capture-activate\fR [\fB\-\-check\fR]
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Load an already installed snd-octa-capture module and bind only Roland USB
0582:0120 or 0582:0121 interfaces. Normal activation requires root.
Unrelated USB audio devices remain on their current drivers.
Unexpected or mixed interface owners are rejected. On a failed rebind from the
generic USB audio driver, activation attempts to restore that previous binding.
.PP
\fB\-\-check\fR is read-only and works without root. It reports whether a present
OCTA-CAPTURE needs activation, without loading, unloading or rebinding modules.
.PP
This command does not build or replace the running kernel or compile a module.
Install a module built for the running kernel first.
EXP recognition does not establish physical EXP streaming or pair synchronization.

.SH EXIT STATUS
Zero indicates success; nonzero indicates a usage, device or operation error.
.SH SEE ALSO
octa-capture(1), octa-status(1), octa-preset(1)
